'''The Legend Begins''' (伝説のはじまり ''Densetsu no Hajimari'', '''Beginning of the Legend''') is the 1st sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]] and introduces the player to Stories of Legend. It was introduced in the [[Version 2.0 Update]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is the 1st sub-chapter and is available up to 3★ difficulty.

==Difficulty==
The easiest sub-chapter, mostly consisting of returning enemies from [[Empire of Cats]]. It introduces three new enemies, but all except [[Doge Dark]] should be easy to deal with.
{{LegendDiff|150|200|300}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces three new enemies:
*[[Metal Hippoe]]: A [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] variant of [[Hippoe]] that attacks non-stop. Like all Metals, it only takes 1 damage from non-[[Critical Hit|Critical]] attacks, but Metal Hippoe's health is so low that it can be beaten by any [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitter]] or [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat/Giraffe Cat]] spam.
*[[St. Pigge the 2nd]]: A much more powerful version of [[Pigge]] that has no attack delay and much higher damage and health, but is still a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy.
*[[Doge Dark]]: A much faster and stronger [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] version of [[Doge]]. Moves incredibly fast and hits decently hard, but has single-target attacks, mediocre health and 8 knockbacks.

